l is available to exercise the powers or perform the \nduties of the office of Postmaster General, an Assistant Postmaster \nGeneral or the General Counsel of the Post Office Department, in such \norder as the Postmaster General may from time to time prescribe in \nwriting, shall act as Postmaster General. I f  no such order of succes­\nsion is in effect at that time, they shall act as Postmaster General in \nthe order in which they shall have taken office as Assistant Postmasters \nGeneral or General Counsel.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"31 FR 13417, PDF pages 9-9; Sec. 2","sha256":"28c731eac574fbd684f7ed7d0218339b7925b1debdfd1b463b007f8dceb42a6f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1966-10-18/pdf/FR-1966-10-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11313#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 3. The fo llo w in g  are hereby superseded:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"31 FR 13417, PDF pages 9-9; Sec. 3 (lead-in)","sha256":"28c731eac574fbd684f7ed7d0218339b7925b1debdfd1b463b007f8dceb42a6f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1966-10-18/pdf/FR-1966-10-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11313#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(1) Executive Order No. 10154 of August 22,1950.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"31 FR 13417, PDF pages 9-9; Sec. 3(1)","sha256":"28c731eac574fbd684f7ed7d0218339b7925b1debdfd1b463b007f8dceb42a6f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1966-10-18/pdf/FR-1966-10-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11313#sec3(1)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(2) Executive Order No. 10558 of September 8,1954.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"31 FR 13417, PDF pages 9-9; Sec. 3(2)","sha256":"28c731eac574fbd684f7ed7d0218339b7925b1debdfd1b463b007f8dceb42a6f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1966-10-18/pdf/F